# AGENTS.md

This repository runs the Repository Learning Protocol (RLP).

- Always-on context is capped at ~1,500 tokens; scoped rules and skills load on trigger.
- New learnings start in `docs/learnings/inbox.md` and are triaged weekly.
- Capture a candidate with `scripts/capture_learnings.sh`; check health with `scripts/learning_health.sh`.
- Every promoted artifact carries provenance (`date`, `source`, `owner`, `scope`, `verify_by`).
- Deletion is a success mode; stale artifacts are pruned monthly.

## Links

- Inbox: `docs/learnings/inbox.md`
- Decisions: `docs/learnings/decisions.md`
